{"id":"juez","lemma":"juez","pos":"noun","rank":810,"glosses":["judge","umpire; referee; official"],"ipa":"/ˈxweθ/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"jueces","feminine":"juez","femininePlural":"jueces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-juez.wav","examples":[{"text":"El juez me interrogó.","en":"The judge questioned me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439897"},{"text":"Ambos son unos jueces muy competentes.","en":"They are both very competent judges.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733494"},{"text":"No me gustaría ser juez.","en":"I wouldn't like being a judge.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553669"},{"text":"El juez golpeó con su martillo.","en":"The judge banged his gavel.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803603"},{"text":"La decisión del juez es definitiva.","en":"The judge's decision is final.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537962"}]}